WEBVTT

00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:16.458
I'm waiting for you all to
be born again right now!

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.875
In the flow of time,

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:23.875
the place where you die
each and every moment

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:26.875
and you are reincarnated
each and every moment...

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:29.750
Where something is born from nothing...

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.417
That is "now"!

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.083
Is this...

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.292
Mikono?

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:44.042
Happy Birthday!

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.458
No...

00:00:56.708 --> 00:01:01.208
<i>You're so beautiful it's depressing</i>

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:09.250
<i>Let's love each other platonically</i>
<i>in this topsy-turvy world</i>

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:25.917
<i>The world we're looking at</i>
<i>is always upside down</i>

00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:34.875
<i>We don't have control</i>
<i>over how things get decided</i>

00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:40.500
<i>You're so hurt that your eyes are in tears</i>

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:46.750
<i>I stayed silent while my heart cried out</i>

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:58.875
<i>While the last two were kept apart,</i>
<i>the countdown has started</i>

00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:03.500
<i>You're so beautiful it's depressing</i>

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:09.375
<i>Let's love each other like animals</i>
<i>on the verge of extinction</i>

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:13.875
<i>You're so beautiful it makes me wanna cry</i>

00:02:13.875 --> 00:02:19.958
<i>I want to feel a platonic love</i>
<i>in this topsy-turvy world</i>

00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:33.417
"Love Beasts"

00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:36.417
They're all weak scents.

00:02:36.417 --> 00:02:38.000
Why is he here?!

00:02:39.042 --> 00:02:42.208
That's the young man we saw before,
the one like a beast...

00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:50.708
Those who don't fulfill the rite of
passage don't grow in a true sense.

00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:54.125
This is, indeed, a proper test for those

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:57.000
who were reborn from the depths of darkness.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.042
Have the girls step back! He's after the girls!

00:03:00.042 --> 00:03:01.542
That sounds discriminatory.

00:03:01.542 --> 00:03:04.833
Now's not the time for that! Stay back!

00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:12.458
He's unarmed! Remember your
hand-to-hand combat training!

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.333
Follow me!

00:03:17.417 --> 00:03:19.167
Wh-What?!

00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:23.625
Donar!

00:03:23.625 --> 00:03:25.208
Instructor!

00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:26.625
Wait!

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:28.583
Leave it to my holes!

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:30.083
Holes?

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:39.750
Amazing!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:42.042
Is this because of the Grave Training?

00:03:42.042 --> 00:03:44.333
Spatial... Augmentation!

00:03:48.792 --> 00:03:51.083
What a great combination!

00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:52.875
Communicating without words...

00:03:52.875 --> 00:03:54.542
The husband leads, the wife follows...

00:03:58.708 --> 00:04:00.250
The Power of Reversal!

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.333
Reversal?

00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:05.375
He turned the power to
fill into the power to open!

00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:07.250
How dare you...

00:04:08.792 --> 00:04:11.208
You bastard! What'd you do to Mix?!

00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:15.042
Tsk... She smells good, too.

00:04:15.042 --> 00:04:16.542
H-Heavy!

00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:20.833
Is that damn woman over there?!

00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:25.333
Why is he only after me?

00:04:27.375 --> 00:04:28.917
Someone, get Mikono out of here!

00:04:28.917 --> 00:04:31.167
Leave it to me! Mikono!

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:32.792
Mikono! Hurry!

00:04:32.792 --> 00:04:34.292
Malloy!

00:04:36.917 --> 00:04:38.417
Hold it!

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:45.000
You bastards... Don't stand
between me and my damn woman!

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.375
How dare you call Mikono "my damn woman"?!

00:04:48.375 --> 00:04:49.875
You won't get away with it!

00:04:55.708 --> 00:04:57.958
Wh-What?!

00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:02.667
Even the damage got reversed!

00:05:06.667 --> 00:05:09.542
Damn woman!

00:05:11.667 --> 00:05:13.500
What eyes...!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.958
They're intently focused on what he wants!

00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:22.417
Be gone!

00:05:38.042 --> 00:05:41.333
These sounds... You... again...

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.375
How dare you pull your strange tricks?!

00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:49.583
I'm just playing the song of
the earth and the atmosphere.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.708
Take this! Reverse!

00:05:55.417 --> 00:06:00.625
I've already learned by ear...
the dissonance of your reversal.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.667
I won't let you stand in my way!

00:06:05.667 --> 00:06:08.375
The damn woman... belongs...

00:06:08.375 --> 00:06:12.167
Belongs just to me!

00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:28.417
So he reversed it in one breath...

00:06:30.292 --> 00:06:33.083
A beast's obsession...

00:06:33.083 --> 00:06:36.500
That tone is interesting in its own way.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.417
He fell in love with Mikono?

00:06:45.417 --> 00:06:49.083
That's the only reason a man
would go after a woman, right?

00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:51.042
Oh, or men after men, too.

00:06:51.042 --> 00:06:53.542
Oh, no... I...

00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:56.792
A wolf?

00:06:58.958 --> 00:07:01.042
It's not! It's him!

00:07:08.417 --> 00:07:12.083
--What?!
--I won't let you escape! Reverse!

00:07:56.875 --> 00:07:58.875
According to the correspondence from Malloy,

00:07:58.875 --> 00:08:03.042
it appears that he kidnapped Mikono
and is hiding somewhere in the city.

00:08:03.042 --> 00:08:05.500
You guys perform a ground search.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.000
Roger.

00:08:24.167 --> 00:08:27.417
Let's split up! You go that way!

00:08:27.417 --> 00:08:29.708
Amata! I'll come with you!

00:08:42.917 --> 00:08:45.083
Amata?

00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:05.042
You came to, damn woman?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:48.625
Don't worry. I'm just going to kill you...

00:09:48.625 --> 00:09:51.375
...in my arms.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.750
Mikono!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.625
Can you hear me, Mykage?

00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:08.125
I obtained the source of the smell.
Let me come back already!

00:10:13.875 --> 00:10:15.500
Can you hear me?!

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:19.125
Am I using it wrong?

00:10:20.833 --> 00:10:23.833
Mykage, are you sleeping?!
I have no business here anymore.

00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:26.250
--I can hear you fine,
--Hurry up and let me come back to Altair!

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.542
--love beast.
--Mykage, answer me! Mykage!

00:10:28.542 --> 00:10:31.958
--I can tease you a bit, can't I?
--What a useless device!

00:10:31.958 --> 00:10:37.958
I'm jealous of you... as you got
what you wanted before me...

00:10:44.167 --> 00:10:46.125
Mikono!

00:10:49.042 --> 00:10:50.542
Amata!

00:10:54.333 --> 00:10:57.958
Calm down, Amata. Mikono's definitely okay.

00:10:57.958 --> 00:10:59.792
I don't need to be consoled!

00:10:59.792 --> 00:11:02.042
I'm not consoling you.

00:11:02.042 --> 00:11:03.708
I can tell.

00:11:03.708 --> 00:11:05.750
You can tell? Tell what?

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:12.458
He'll never do anything to harm Mikono.

00:11:12.458 --> 00:11:14.333
How can you tell that?

00:11:14.333 --> 00:11:15.917
It's because...

00:11:17.208 --> 00:11:20.167
...he's her man of destiny.

00:11:21.875 --> 00:11:26.875
Her man of destiny isn't you, Amata.

00:11:46.542 --> 00:11:48.792
You smell...

00:11:48.792 --> 00:11:50.583
You really do stink.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:56.750
Why? Why do you always
say such terrible things?

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.750
Because I hate you.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:01.792
Because I want to kill you.

00:12:01.792 --> 00:12:03.750
Why?

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:07.083
I haven't done anything to you.

00:12:07.083 --> 00:12:09.542
You're at fault for being on Vega.

00:12:09.542 --> 00:12:13.125
What...? Then...

00:12:13.125 --> 00:12:15.542
...go ahead and kill me right here, right now!

00:12:15.542 --> 00:12:17.250
What?

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.792
I didn't mean that.

00:12:20.333 --> 00:12:26.042
I-I can't. Not even I could
do it in a place like this.

00:12:26.042 --> 00:12:28.333
What? What do you mean?

00:12:38.917 --> 00:12:40.833
S-Stop it!

00:12:42.292 --> 00:12:45.917
If you tell me to stop it, then I'll stop.

00:12:46.958 --> 00:12:50.125
Y-You're not stopping! No!

00:12:54.292 --> 00:12:56.417
You want me to lick you, too?

00:13:08.458 --> 00:13:11.667
I hate you.

00:13:11.667 --> 00:13:14.208
I-I want to kill you.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.792
Could it be...

00:13:17.792 --> 00:13:19.542
...reversed?

00:13:20.958 --> 00:13:23.500
Just to you, I lie.

00:13:31.875 --> 00:13:33.708
Why...?

00:13:33.708 --> 00:13:35.667
His eyes...

00:13:35.667 --> 00:13:38.417
They make me feel kinda nostalgic.

00:13:40.708 --> 00:13:42.167
I finally found you.

00:13:42.167 --> 00:13:43.375
What?

00:13:43.375 --> 00:13:45.833
Let's go together, Silffy.

00:13:45.833 --> 00:13:51.250
Silffy... This isn't the first
time you've called me that.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:55.250
Silffy and Apollon... They're our myth.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:02.500
On the first day of the world,
under the Tree of Life...

00:14:03.708 --> 00:14:08.583
The great Tree of Life lives on a planet.

00:14:08.583 --> 00:14:12.583
And it has been controlling
the very life of the planet.

00:14:14.125 --> 00:14:17.250
In the battle between two races,

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:23.875
the Solar Wing awakens and
the Tree of Life pollinates.

00:14:23.875 --> 00:14:29.958
However, its flowers wither
away without bearing fruits.

00:14:31.042 --> 00:14:37.375
As it stood, it would become a
barren land, never sprouting lives.

00:14:37.375 --> 00:14:39.833
So, in order to protect the Tree of Life,

00:14:39.833 --> 00:14:44.667
the lovers, Apollon and Silffy,
separated from each other.

00:14:44.667 --> 00:14:46.750
And Silffy said...

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:51.125
"I will continue to wait for you...

00:14:51.125 --> 00:14:54.542
...even if I have to wait ten thousand
years and two thousand more."

00:14:56.125 --> 00:14:59.500
"Wait for me, Silffy.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.750
Let's meet again in twelve thousand years."

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.750
That's Apollon's line...

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.542
Right, that's me.

00:15:09.792 --> 00:15:11.458
I'm...

00:15:11.458 --> 00:15:14.958
You are... Apollon?

00:15:16.125 --> 00:15:17.917
And you are...

00:15:17.917 --> 00:15:20.000
I am...?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:24.292
Do you want to say... Mikono is Silffy?

00:15:24.292 --> 00:15:28.250
That's not possible. How can
you say such a stupid thing?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.625
Because I saw them.

00:15:29.625 --> 00:15:31.125
"Saw them"?

00:15:34.792 --> 00:15:38.583
The image Cayenne had of the wedding
in mourning clothes makes sense, too.

00:15:38.583 --> 00:15:40.167
You saw it, too, right?

00:15:40.167 --> 00:15:45.792
Either way, the story about
Apollon and Silffy is just a legend!

00:15:45.792 --> 00:15:49.000
Can you really say that for sure?

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:52.417
I was a bit glad.

00:15:52.417 --> 00:15:56.667
If Mikono is linked with him by destiny,

00:15:56.667 --> 00:15:59.625
maybe you and I are...

00:16:00.792 --> 00:16:03.333
Zessica, what're you talking about?

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.833
A butterfly?

00:16:07.833 --> 00:16:09.625
This late at night?

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.083
No...

00:16:20.083 --> 00:16:23.292
I'm not Silffy.

00:16:25.333 --> 00:16:28.167
I'm not Silf...

00:16:28.167 --> 00:16:29.708
Silffy!

00:16:34.958 --> 00:16:36.625
What was that?

00:16:36.625 --> 00:16:38.542
Mikono!

00:16:38.542 --> 00:16:40.042
Amata!

00:16:47.875 --> 00:16:50.542
Don't scare me like that, Silffy.

00:16:50.542 --> 00:16:52.458
Mikono!

00:16:55.042 --> 00:16:57.917
Mikono!

00:16:57.917 --> 00:16:59.333
Amata!

00:16:59.333 --> 00:17:01.000
Him again!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.500
Amata!

00:17:09.333 --> 00:17:11.000
How persistent!

00:17:17.125 --> 00:17:18.667
Amata!

00:17:21.917 --> 00:17:23.833
Amata!

00:17:23.833 --> 00:17:27.042
I'm okay. I felt like I could do it.

00:17:27.042 --> 00:17:28.375
Do what?

00:17:28.375 --> 00:17:30.583
I wonder if it was because of the training...

00:17:30.583 --> 00:17:34.125
I was able to offset his power a bit.

00:17:34.125 --> 00:17:35.625
He's coming!

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.750
As I planned, he's coming after me.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:45.917
I'll get him away from Mikono!
Contact Cayenne!

00:17:48.333 --> 00:17:51.625
Oh, no... He's being a hero.

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:05.250
There she is! It's Mikono!

00:18:24.792 --> 00:18:26.292
Amata!

00:18:26.292 --> 00:18:30.500
Cayenne said he'd come to help! So step back!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:36.042
Not yet! Until Mikono has completely
escaped, I have to attract his attention!

00:18:36.042 --> 00:18:37.542
Amata...

00:18:42.542 --> 00:18:44.750
I've had enough! I'm gonna kill you!

00:19:00.042 --> 00:19:01.875
D-Dammit!

00:19:10.417 --> 00:19:11.875
I'll kill you...!

00:19:11.875 --> 00:19:13.458
I'll kill you!

00:19:13.458 --> 00:19:17.042
Over... and over again!

00:19:25.542 --> 00:19:30.375
A-Am I going to die here?

00:19:31.708 --> 00:19:35.875
Am I sinking... into that darkness?

00:19:35.875 --> 00:19:40.042
Will I become alone again... in that darkness?

00:19:41.375 --> 00:19:45.417
Amata Sora. You don't have to fear.

00:19:45.417 --> 00:19:51.208
The darkness is no longer a place
where you agonize over your feelings.

00:19:51.208 --> 00:19:55.292
It's a place where you cut off your
attachments and become connected...

00:19:56.583 --> 00:20:00.208
That's right. In the darkness and the loneliness,

00:20:00.208 --> 00:20:04.708
I'll abandon the past and
attachments that bind me and...

00:20:16.292 --> 00:20:20.542
You never learn, do you?! Fly! Head over heels!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:25.750
Why?! My power isn't working!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:30.458
Those without attachments
are confused by nothing!

00:20:37.333 --> 00:20:39.542
You bastard!

00:20:46.958 --> 00:20:49.750
--Cayenne!
--Looks like I made it on time.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.458
Don't let your guard down, Amata!
Stay there until I settle this!

00:21:04.583 --> 00:21:06.667
Amata! Finish him off!

00:21:14.542 --> 00:21:18.917
Show no mercy! We are
in a life-or-death situation!

00:21:25.625 --> 00:21:27.167
Don't!

00:21:27.167 --> 00:21:29.167
Don't shoot him, Amata!

00:21:30.167 --> 00:21:31.250
Mikono!

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.750
Mikono...

00:21:35.042 --> 00:21:36.833
Mikono!

00:21:36.833 --> 00:21:38.917
Amata, please!

00:21:38.917 --> 00:21:40.750
Don't shoot him.

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:43.958
Please forgive him!

00:21:46.333 --> 00:21:47.875
Mikono...

00:22:24.208 --> 00:22:27.250
Mikono... why...

00:22:32.708 --> 00:22:37.750
Right... Just like the
butterflies that imply revival...

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:42.375
Forbidden lovers... it's time to return to life...

00:22:42.375 --> 00:22:46.125
...after ten thousand years
and two thousand more.

00:22:59.292 --> 00:23:07.208
<i>I saw a white flower on a slope</i>
<i>on my way towards you</i>

00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Even after awaking from my dream,</i>
<i>I gazed at a sad sky</i>

00:23:19.417 --> 00:23:25.208
<i>This feeling lives on a leaf's back</i>

00:23:26.833 --> 00:23:34.667
<i>I listen closely to the sound </i>
<i>of the falling morning dew</i>

00:23:34.667 --> 00:23:42.458
<i>God, the world you created is not perfect</i>

00:23:42.458 --> 00:23:50.250
<i>Here, every day many loves fall and die</i>

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:54.083
<i>This was my first time falling in love</i>

00:23:54.083 --> 00:23:57.375
<i>You don't even know it, do you...</i>

00:23:57.375 --> 00:24:01.833
<i>Even if you were on the other side of the earth,</i>

00:24:01.833 --> 00:24:05.042
<i>I wanted you to be by my side</i>

00:24:05.042 --> 00:24:09.542
<i>Even if you were going to forget about me,</i>

00:24:09.542 --> 00:24:15.625
<i>I wanted you to be by my side</i>

00:24:20.417 --> 00:24:23.875
The scent of total fermentation
that gets me excited...

00:24:23.875 --> 00:24:27.042
It's the scent of our
twelve-thousand-year destiny.

00:24:30.208 --> 00:24:30.958
"Next Episode 'Soul's Confession'"
Surrender yourself to this smell, Silffy.

00:24:30.958 --> 00:24:33.417
"Next Episode 'Soul's Confession'"
If you resist, it'll hurt.
